    "catalogue_description": "Here I present you guys my first map. First of all I have to say that this map is really challenging and difficult. I hope you enjoy it! Features \u2013 Double Tap 2.0 \u2013 4-5 hit Juggernog \u2013 8 Perks \u2013 Black Ops Quick Revive \u2013 Custom Pack-a-Punch camo \u2013 Custom Textures \u2013 Few ported CoD MW1 weapons \u2013 3 teddy bear Easter Egg (opens secret door that leads to the outside) \u2013 Buyable End \u2013 No Hellhounds \u2013 UGX Jukebox \u2013 Edited WaW Weapons files like damage, clip size and so on Credits \u2013 Bamskater \u2013 ZOMB1E-KLLR \u2013 CactusDude123 \u2013 unholyorange \u2013 thezombiekilla6 Update 03.09.2014 \u2013 Fixed some bugs / glitches \u2013 Removed Flamethrower \u2013 Added Skorpion \u2013 Replaced AK47 Grenadier with the AK47 since there was a bug that if you Pack-a-Punch it you could get more than 2 weapons",
